In KDE Dolphin, UI colors are primarily controlled by `~/.config/kdeglobals`, while Dolphin can select its own color scheme through `~/.config/dolphinrc`.

## 1. dolphinrc – select color scheme

File: `~/.config/dolphinrc`

ini

```ini
[UiSettings]
ColorScheme=BreezeDark
```

Examples:

ini

```ini
ColorScheme=BreezeDark
ColorScheme=BreezeLight
ColorScheme=*
```

`*` means use the system color scheme.

